{"format":1,"id":"atem_beobachten","kurz":"ab","sprache":"ar","richtung":"rtl","titel":"ملاحظة التنفّس","untertitel":"دَعِ النَّفَس يأتي ويذهب. وإذا شردت الأفكار، فعُدْ إليه بلطف.","haltung":["sitzen","liegen"],"augen":"zu_oder_offen","ende":"glocke","schlaf_modus":false,"laengen":{"kurz":{"ziel_s":300},"normal":{"ziel_s":600},"lang":{"ziel_s":1200}},"kb":1073,"abschnitte":[{"id":"ankommen","segmente":[{"id":"s001","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/1.ab748c72.mp3","ms":5473,"text":"اجلسْ جلسةً مريحةً وظهرُك مستقيم، أو استلقِ على ظهرك.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s002","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/2.decd1197.mp3","ms":7594,"text":"أغمِضْ عينيك إن شئت. ويمكنك أيضًا أن تُبقيهما مفتوحتين وتُخفِض نظرك.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s003","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/3.efaa5bfc.mp3","ms":5684,"text":"يمكنك أن تتوقّف في أي وقت، إذا شعرتَ أن شيئًا لا يناسبك.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2,"lang":3}},{"id":"s004","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/4.3d585cc9.mp3","ms":7141,"text":"اشعُرْ بجسمك وهو محمول: على الكرسي، أو على الأرض، أو على ما تستلقي عليه.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s005","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/5.0a8e1768.mp3","ms":2601,"text":"دَعْ كتفيك تنزلان قليلًا.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s006","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/6.24806849.mp3","ms":1791,"text":"ودَعْ وجهك يلين.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":3,"lang":5}}]},{"id":"atem","segmente":[{"id":"s007","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/7.8866ee74.mp3","ms":2975,"text":"وجِّهِ الآن انتباهك إلى تنفّسك.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s008","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/8.6de8e0b5.mp3","ms":5963,"text":"لا حاجة إلى أن تغيّر شيئًا. النَّفَسُ يدخل ويخرج وحدَه.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s009","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/9.3224c9c7.mp3","ms":7030,"text":"اخترْ موضعًا تشعر فيه بالنَّفَس بوضوح: عند الأنف، أو في الصدر، أو في البطن.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s010","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/10.9ea225de.mp3","ms":3059,"text":"اشعُرْ بالشهيق. وبالزفير.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s011","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/11.b8dc4506.mp3","ms":7852,"text":"إذا شعرتَ بعدم ارتياحٍ مع التنفّس، يمكنك بدلًا من ذلك أن تُصغي إلى الأصوات من حولك.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s012","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/12.6d9a81d9.mp3","ms":5867,"text":"أو أن تشعر بقدميك على الأرض. وإليهما تعودُ في كلّ مرّة.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s013","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/13.08426dc9.mp3","ms":3828,"text":"ربما تلاحظ كيف يرتفع البطن وينخفض.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s014","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/14.b6d1c683.mp3","ms":5975,"text":"أو كيف يدخل الهواء عند الأنف أبردَ قليلًا، ويخرج أدفأَ قليلًا.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st01","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":37,"normal":55.5,"lang":69.5}}]},{"id":"abschweifen","segmente":[{"id":"s015","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/15.709b83de.mp3","ms":6185,"text":"عاجلًا أو آجلًا ستشرد أفكارك. وهذا أمرٌ طبيعيٌّ تمامًا.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s016","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/16.3700415d.mp3","ms":4260,"text":"حين تلاحظ ذلك، قُلْ في نَفْسك: تفكير.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s017","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/17.b66909d4.mp3","ms":2442,"text":"ثم عُدْ بلطفٍ إلى تنفّسك.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s018","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/18.944d275e.mp3","ms":5116,"text":"أنت لا تخطئ في شيء. فالعودةُ هي جوهرُ التمرين.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"st02","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":37,"normal":55.5,"lang":69.5}},{"id":"s019","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/19.7e3dabe7.mp3","ms":4201,"text":"اشعُرْ بالنَّفَس التالي. بهذا النَّفَسِ وحدَه.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"st03","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":37,"normal":55.5,"lang":69.5}},{"id":"s020","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/20.5cb88aa6.mp3","ms":5588,"text":"أين أفكارك الآن؟ إن كانت قد شردت، فعُدْ ببساطة.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s021","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/21.24f2af32.mp3","ms":1706,"text":"إلى هذا النَّفَسِ الواحد.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"st04","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":55.5,"lang":69.5}},{"id":"s022","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/22.9572cb9d.mp3","ms":6267,"text":"ربما يظهر شيءٌ من التململ أو المَلَل. وهذا أيضًا لا بأس به.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s023","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/23.c5fa7373.mp3","ms":2723,"text":"لاحِظْه، ثم عُدْ إلى التنفّس.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s024","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/24.0669f2e0.mp3","ms":2236,"text":"كلُّ نَفَسٍ بدايةٌ جديدة.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"st05","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":55.5,"lang":69.5}},{"id":"s025","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/25.6bea7d79.mp3","ms":4626,"text":"لاحِظْ أين يبدأ الشهيق. وأين ينتهي الزفير.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":8}},{"id":"s026","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/26.d276592d.mp3","ms":4893,"text":"ربما توجد وقفةٌ قصيرة، قبل أن يأتي النَّفَسُ التالي.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":8}},{"id":"st06","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":69.5}},{"id":"s027","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/27.dd55e8f7.mp3","ms":7042,"text":"إذا شعرتَ بالنعاس، اعتدِلْ في جلستك قليلًا. أو افتحْ عينيك لحظة.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":6.5}},{"id":"st07","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":69.5}},{"id":"s028","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/28.fe63a2da.mp3","ms":6659,"text":"إذا اشتدّ شعورٌ ما، فلا بأس أن تلاحظه. ثم تعود إلى التنفّس.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":6.5}},{"id":"st08","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":69.5}},{"id":"s029","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/29.5f213cdf.mp3","ms":4904,"text":"لا شيء عليك أن تحقّقه. فقط لاحِظْ، وعُدْ.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":8}},{"id":"st09","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":69.5}}]},{"id":"weiten","segmente":[{"id":"s030","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/30.1651914a.mp3","ms":2300,"text":"دَعِ انتباهك الآن يتّسع.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s031","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/31.4d033c6b.mp3","ms":5361,"text":"اشعُرْ بجسمك كلِّه، وهو جالسٌ أو مستلقٍ، ويتنفّس.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s032","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/32.065eaaf3.mp3","ms":4572,"text":"الأصوات والأفكار والأحاسيس، دَعْها تأتي وتذهب.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"st10","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":37,"normal":55.5,"lang":69.5}},{"id":"s033","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/33.8cbaaa06.mp3","ms":3989,"text":"ابقَ هكذا بعض الوقت، بانفتاحٍ ويقظة.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":6.5}},{"id":"st11","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":69.5}}]},{"id":"rueckkehr","segmente":[{"id":"s034","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/34.4fcea4ec.mp3","ms":4056,"text":"تقترب الآن، بهدوء، من نهاية التمرين.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s035","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/35.a6f59410.mp3","ms":4825,"text":"خُذْ نَفَسًا أعمقَ قليلًا. ثم أخرِجْه ببطء.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s036","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/36.48171204.mp3","ms":2576,"text":"حرِّكْ أصابع يديك وقدميك.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s037","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/37.1b65f191.mp3","ms":2671,"text":"ومتى شئت، افتحْ عينيك.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s038","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/38.741de383.mp3","ms":5514,"text":"وربما تأخذ شيئًا من هذا الهدوء معك، إلى ما سيأتي بعد ذلك.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s039","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/39.00e441ca.mp3","ms":3243,"text":"وإن كنتَ مستلقيًا، فانهضْ ببطء.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2,"lang":3}},{"id":"glocke","art":"glocke","ton":"ende"}]}]}